# ROOFCAT: paper lanterns drift up at 3,000 and 7,000 points and then every
# 5,000; popping one with a star is an extra life.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 0 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat cam 0
wait 10
expect lanterns == 0
cheat score 3000
expect lanterns == 1
expect next_life == 7000
cheat score 7000
expect next_life == 12000
cheat score 12000
expect next_life == 17000
cheat clear_foes
cheat put 40 83
cheat lantern 100 86
expect lives == 3
press B
wait 20
expect lives == 4
